ranked_high(V) => active_major(V). @ "If someone is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association, then they are one of the most active players in major tennis."
lost_to_iga(V) => ranked_high(V). @ "Everyone who lost to Iga Świątek at Roland Garros 2022 is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association."
female(V) & at_rg22(V) => lost_to_iga(V). @ "All female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek."
at_rg22(V) & not female(V) => male(V). @ "All tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are either female or male."
male(V) & at_rg22(V) => lost_to_nadal(V). @ "All male tennis players at Roland Garros in 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal."
ranked_high(coco_gauff) => not male(coco_gauff). @ "If Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association or lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022."
lost_to_nadal(coco_gauff) => not male(coco_gauff). @ "If Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association or lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022."
at_rg22(coco_gauff). @ "Coco Gauff is at Roland Garros 2022."
? lost_to_nadal(coco_gauff).
